WEBVTT

00:00:26.041 --> 00:00:29.000
MISSION 10
THOUSAND DEMON DAGGERS

00:00:34.375 --> 00:00:36.458
This mission is so dangerous.

00:00:36.541 --> 00:00:38.250
I should charge you more.

00:00:39.833 --> 00:00:42.083
We are not taking on this mission!

00:00:43.875 --> 00:00:48.000
Dai Bo, you've always
decided what missions to take on.

00:00:48.916 --> 00:00:52.333
However, this time,
I really want to complete this mission.

00:00:52.958 --> 00:00:54.625
Please, let me make a decision this time.

00:00:57.833 --> 00:01:00.083
But you're going to die if you go.

00:01:00.166 --> 00:01:02.083
Do you know how powerful
the opponents are?

00:01:02.916 --> 00:01:06.250
How would I know if I don't try my best?

00:01:11.625 --> 00:01:13.291
<i>I have to challenge King Pheasant.</i>

00:01:13.375 --> 00:01:15.416
<i>How can a blue feather chicken</i>
<i>defeat a pheasant?</i>

00:01:15.500 --> 00:01:17.125
<i>How would I know if I don't try my best?</i>

00:01:17.708 --> 00:01:20.541
<i>Da Fei, you two have a lot in common.</i>

00:01:22.583 --> 00:01:24.958
I don't care if you want to die,

00:01:25.541 --> 00:01:28.166
but how are you going to fight
with no weapons?

00:01:28.250 --> 00:01:31.208
This should be the dagger you used
before you lost your memory.

00:01:31.791 --> 00:01:35.583
I told you before you lost your memory

00:01:35.666 --> 00:01:38.666
that we were childhood friends.

00:01:38.750 --> 00:01:41.750
Actually, I lied to you.

00:01:44.541 --> 00:01:48.041
<i>I found you on the beach two years ago.</i>

00:01:49.083 --> 00:01:51.541
<i>You almost died then,</i>

00:01:52.375 --> 00:01:55.250
<i>but that miracle doctor healed you...</i>

00:01:56.750 --> 00:01:59.000
<i>and I owed him</i>
<i>a large amount in medical fees.</i>

00:01:59.083 --> 00:02:00.083
¥100,0000
MEDICAL FEE

00:02:00.666 --> 00:02:03.791
That's why I tricked you
into becoming a killer to pay it back.

00:02:04.583 --> 00:02:08.583
I also made up your name Seven.

00:02:09.375 --> 00:02:12.916
Gone already?
Did he even hear what I just said?

00:02:14.958 --> 00:02:15.875
Hey, hey, hey!

00:02:15.958 --> 00:02:18.833
Where are you going, Xiao Fei?
Come back here!

00:02:20.583 --> 00:02:23.750
I'm going to break your leg
when you come back!

00:02:56.500 --> 00:02:58.458
How did the dagger crack like this?

00:02:58.958 --> 00:03:00.375
Whatever.

00:03:00.458 --> 00:03:02.583
I'll chop Four Eyes up
even with a butcher knife.

00:03:20.583 --> 00:03:23.958
Dai Bo, you really ripped me off
with this messed-up dagger.

00:03:48.875 --> 00:03:51.291
<i>The flying device under his feet</i>
<i>has an automatic dodging function,</i>

00:03:51.375 --> 00:03:52.500
<i>and it reacts very fast.</i>

00:03:53.708 --> 00:03:55.583
Hi, Ms. Thirteen. Such a coincidence!

00:03:55.666 --> 00:03:57.250
You're here for
the mountaintop scenery, too?

00:03:58.625 --> 00:04:02.625
The computer data indicates that you are
a female killer from Xuanwu, Thirteen.

00:04:02.708 --> 00:04:05.583
You even killed Dr. Chen Jiajie
from our country of Stan.

00:04:07.666 --> 00:04:09.833
We were already enemy countries.

00:04:09.916 --> 00:04:11.958
The Prince of Stan's head
is worth so much money.

00:04:12.750 --> 00:04:14.166
How can I pass up the chance?

00:04:15.166 --> 00:04:17.291
Well, let's see if you have the skills.

00:04:18.000 --> 00:04:19.000
Wow, flying chicken!

00:04:20.166 --> 00:04:21.000
Childish.

00:04:26.250 --> 00:04:28.583
Transformation!

00:04:37.583 --> 00:04:38.958
MUSCULAR CHICKEN

00:04:42.166 --> 00:04:43.416
Level Ten Protection Shield.

00:04:53.375 --> 00:04:55.875
You brawny, brainless, inferior creature.

00:04:56.666 --> 00:04:58.625
SPECIAL SKILL OF THE GYMNASTICS MAN

00:04:59.208 --> 00:05:00.541
What are you waiting for?

00:05:00.625 --> 00:05:02.250
Strike together when the timing is right.

00:05:09.583 --> 00:05:12.458
Bastard! Flying back without me.

00:05:12.541 --> 00:05:14.625
My chicken wings are numb
from rowing the boat.

00:05:15.791 --> 00:05:18.958
The Gymnastics Man's
Lightning Poisonous Dragon Drill!

00:05:38.083 --> 00:05:41.250
<i>The protection shield can't block</i>
<i>such a strong strike.</i>

00:05:41.333 --> 00:05:42.750
<i>It's time to use the ultimate move.</i>

00:05:57.416 --> 00:05:58.875
COMBAT MODE
FULL ON

00:06:14.583 --> 00:06:17.958
So embarrassing.
I even had to use the highest level form.

00:06:18.583 --> 00:06:20.708
How come your full body armor
doesn't protect you there?

00:06:20.791 --> 00:06:22.000
That would be a bad influence on children.

00:06:24.416 --> 00:06:27.583
He's controlling his movements
through the machine...

00:06:28.208 --> 00:06:29.375
and reacting faster.

00:06:40.583 --> 00:06:42.666
That's so unfair.

00:06:42.750 --> 00:06:44.833
Such a big difference between our weapons.

00:06:57.541 --> 00:07:00.083
My thighs are sore.

00:07:00.750 --> 00:07:02.500
How much longer till I get to the top?

00:07:14.500 --> 00:07:16.208
I saved him.

00:07:16.291 --> 00:07:17.916
It's not up to you to kill him.

00:07:18.958 --> 00:07:20.458
Die together then, you two.

00:07:23.375 --> 00:07:24.625
Plum Blossom Defense.

00:07:31.083 --> 00:07:32.708
Let's see how you block this one.

00:07:40.083 --> 00:07:41.291
Look out!

00:07:53.291 --> 00:07:54.625
<i>Seven, he...</i>

00:07:55.375 --> 00:07:57.291
<i>He pushed me away at that moment.</i>

00:07:59.333 --> 00:08:00.375
<i>Is he already...</i>

00:08:11.541 --> 00:08:14.833
DaChun, I've already
learned your unique skill.

00:08:18.875 --> 00:08:19.708
HIGH IMITATION

00:08:19.791 --> 00:08:21.291
Imitation Solid as Gold Seven-Day Lock!

00:08:23.958 --> 00:08:25.583
Thirteen!

00:08:26.208 --> 00:08:27.583
You don't have to tell me.
I know what to do.

00:08:29.625 --> 00:08:30.583
Time Freeze.

00:08:33.041 --> 00:08:35.375
<i>Damn. Why can't I move?</i>

00:08:37.958 --> 00:08:41.166
Four Eyes, you are really something.

00:08:41.958 --> 00:08:45.958
However, you forgot something
very important.

00:08:47.250 --> 00:08:50.458
Focus. Qi Controlled Scissors!

00:08:51.416 --> 00:08:52.916
<i>Aren't his scissors broken?</i>

00:08:54.083 --> 00:08:54.916
<i>Could it be?</i>

00:09:15.250 --> 00:09:19.500
I am the senior hair stylist
of Dai Bo J Hair Salon!

00:09:28.000 --> 00:09:30.708
Go to hell, Four Eyes!

00:09:48.708 --> 00:09:53.166
<i>Everyone has something</i>
<i>they want to protect.</i>

00:09:53.250 --> 00:09:54.083
<i>What about me?</i>

00:10:07.250 --> 00:10:08.291
<i>Seven...</i>

00:10:32.833 --> 00:10:34.291
I really almost died.

00:10:37.041 --> 00:10:39.083
Humans have such weak hearts.

00:10:39.166 --> 00:10:41.375
I had a replacement heart
installed a long time ago.

00:10:41.875 --> 00:10:43.333
It's time to put an end to this.

00:10:53.458 --> 00:10:56.083
I'm the King of Chicken!

00:10:56.166 --> 00:10:58.541
You can call me Chicken King!

00:11:01.250 --> 00:11:03.875
Man, these stairs almost killed me!

00:11:04.541 --> 00:11:06.375
Didn't anyone tell you?

00:11:06.875 --> 00:11:09.583
This young man is my guy.

00:11:12.333 --> 00:11:14.041
I'm very annoyed now.

00:11:15.125 --> 00:11:17.041
Help!

00:11:17.625 --> 00:11:20.250
Xiao Fei, hurry up and take Seven away!

00:11:33.000 --> 00:11:37.666
<i>From now on, you're the strongest</i>
<i>Shadow Killer in Xuanwu.</i>

00:11:38.333 --> 00:11:40.000
<i>Your code name is "Seven."</i>

00:11:40.791 --> 00:11:42.250
<i>Why must you save this woman?</i>

00:11:43.041 --> 00:11:44.958
<i>Are you planning to be the enemy</i>
<i>of the entire killer alliance?</i>

00:11:45.541 --> 00:11:46.666
<i>Have you thought it through?</i>

00:11:47.416 --> 00:11:48.458
<i>The Chief has already placed</i>
<i>a killing order.</i>

00:11:49.041 --> 00:11:51.041
<i>Every killer is hunting you down</i>
<i>right now.</i>

00:11:52.833 --> 00:11:55.041
I have to take her away today.

00:11:55.125 --> 00:11:57.708
I'll see who dares to stop me.

00:12:49.666 --> 00:12:52.416
You two are unexpectedly resilient.

00:13:15.458 --> 00:13:16.541
Seven!

00:13:23.666 --> 00:13:25.833
I have to take her away today.

00:13:25.916 --> 00:13:28.083
I'll see who dares to stop me.

00:13:28.875 --> 00:13:30.916
<i>Why does he seem like a different person?</i>

00:13:31.000 --> 00:13:32.666
<i>Even I'm feeling scared.</i>

00:14:03.708 --> 00:14:05.125
Level Twenty Energy Shield!

00:14:21.333 --> 00:14:23.083
-How?
-Goodbye.

00:14:29.416 --> 00:14:32.541
I still have a secret weapon.
Initiate Robot Mode.

00:14:45.958 --> 00:14:47.416
I will destroy this island.

00:15:12.833 --> 00:15:14.708
I'll be back!

00:15:25.583 --> 00:15:27.333
Seven, you are awesome!

00:15:29.125 --> 00:15:30.541
Go away if you don't want to die.

00:15:31.125 --> 00:15:34.083
I'm a Shadow Killer of Xuanwu...

00:15:34.916 --> 00:15:35.916
Seven.

00:15:39.000 --> 00:15:40.333
Master, did you see that?

00:15:40.416 --> 00:15:42.625
TRANSCENDENTAL VISION:
A LIVE VIDEO STREAMING SPECIAL TALENT

00:15:43.208 --> 00:15:45.333
Kill him and bring back the dagger.

00:15:47.208 --> 00:15:48.666
You are not dead?

00:15:51.333 --> 00:15:54.125
IN SURGERY

00:15:54.208 --> 00:15:56.041
DAI BO J HAIR SALON

00:15:57.166 --> 00:16:02.125
XiaoLong, Grandma picked up
a lot of fish today!

00:16:02.208 --> 00:16:04.625
I'll make you fish soup when I get back.

00:16:04.708 --> 00:16:08.333
Xiao Fei, will Seven become
a different person?

00:16:09.125 --> 00:16:12.166
We need to finish him off
for the safety of this island.

00:16:13.500 --> 00:16:16.666
We can't do that! Seven saved us!

00:16:18.333 --> 00:16:20.625
You don't know
how terrifying he was just then.

00:16:34.333 --> 00:16:38.291
Wow, what day is today? There are
so many people waiting to get a haircut!

00:16:38.375 --> 00:16:40.416
Who wants to go first?

00:16:40.500 --> 00:16:43.083
-Seven!
-He woke up.

00:16:43.166 --> 00:16:44.375
Seven!

00:16:47.625 --> 00:16:49.125
Where are my scissors?

00:16:51.541 --> 00:16:54.166
Your scissors are way too damaged.
They are beyond repair.

00:16:54.750 --> 00:16:57.958
But I made you a pair exactly like them
with Tianshan dark steel.

00:17:00.791 --> 00:17:02.791
Want to go for a drink together later?

00:17:09.916 --> 00:17:10.916
RUOZHI ELEMENTARY SCHOOL

00:17:13.083 --> 00:17:14.375
DON'T CELEBRATE THE ENDING JUST YET...

00:17:14.458 --> 00:17:15.333
COAST GUARD

00:17:15.416 --> 00:17:16.791
HEADQUARTERS OF THE DOGS

00:17:16.875 --> 00:17:20.750
THIS IS JUST THE BEGINNING
OF SEVEN'S STORY.

00:17:23.416 --> 00:17:24.500
DAI BO J
HAIR SALON

00:17:29.041 --> 00:17:30.541
Let's go, Seven.

00:17:31.958 --> 00:17:33.958
Leave this mission to me.
